// Organic Maps (app.organicmaps, Apache-2.0): offline OpenStreetMap navigation. Google Maps needs a
// Play-certified device, so this is the on-device navigation app.
// The APK is our own fdroid release build (arm64 only) of the aaos-map-provider branch of
// git@github.com:gschuurman/organicmaps.git: it adds the Android Automotive map card that CarLauncher
// embeds on its home screen (automotive/MapCardActivity, CATEGORY_APP_MAPS) with a navigation banner.
// Build: see ~/android/om-release.sh, then repacked with the JNI libs stored uncompressed + zipalign -P 16
// (required for a "preprocessed" prebuilt) and re-signed with our own release key (~/android/keys). Kept
// as is by the build, so newer builds of ours install as updates.
android_app_import {
    name: "OrganicMaps",
    apk: "OrganicMaps.apk",
    presigned: true,
    preprocessed: true,
    dex_preopt: {
        enabled: false,
    },
}
